title KEYBOARD view, HOST layout quick switch held open: the pinned layouts first, then the recents that are not pinned, the layout in force marked (ADR-039 section 8)
view keyboard
caps off
layout_id de
layout_fav de us fr(oss)
layout_recent us pl cz
step hold_quick
